      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. for the section on redlining and institutional racism, i want to make sure the students understand that these aren't just \"historical mistakes\" but are actually built into the foundation of how the economy works today. can you expand on how current banking policies and credit models are basically just modern-day versions of those old discriminatory practices?",
